abstract: >-
  Reproducibility software, derived numerical data, retained checkpoints, and
  verification workflows for the study of edge-localized Floquet instabilities
  and Nyquist solitary-wave shedding from numerical compactons. Source code is
  licensed under MIT; derived research data and workflow-generated figures are
  licensed under CC BY 4.0.
